    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "アルダンさん、\r\nお誕生日おめでとうございます。",
            "enText": "Ardan, I wish you a very happy birthday.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 575146337865508157,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "おめでとうございます。",
            "enText": "Happy birthday.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -275753893495890458,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "まあ、ありがとう。こうやって近くで\r\nお祝いされるのはなんだか新鮮ですね。",
            "enText": "My, thank you. There's something \nnovel about hearing you two say that \nfrom up close like this.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 7797258579589335893,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "そうでしょうか？\r\nメジロ家でもよく、こんな風に――",
            "enText": "Is that so? But back at the estate, \nwe would also ——",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -1740026460448859700,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "ええ、お祝いしていただいたものですね。\r\n大きなテーブルを隔てて。",
            "enText": "Yes, you would wish me a happy \nbirthday — from across that \nenormous table, that is.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 8936009750090122919,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "……確かに。メジロ家のテーブルって、\r\nすごく大きかったですよね。席が遠いと\n顔もよく見えないくらい。",
            "enText": "True… The table at the estate was pretty \nmassive. You could hardly see people's \nfaces at the other end.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 7116710121988970185,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "だから嬉しいのです。\r\nこうしてちゃんと目を見て\nお祝いの言葉をいただけるのが。",
            "enText": "That's why this is so nice, being able \nto look each other in the eye while \nexchanging well wishes.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -171362867660780277,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ふふ、でしたら今日はたくさんお祝い\r\nいたしましょう。",
            "enText": "Heh, then I suppose we'll have to say it \nmany more times throughout the day.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -4149464329936113310,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "うん。近くで目を見ながら、ね。",
            "enText": "Yeah, up close and personal.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 4175430492490168676,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "ありがとうございます、お2人とも。とても\r\n楽しいお誕生日になりそう！　ふふっ。",
            "enText": "Thank you very much, you two. It looks like \nthis will be a birthday to remember! Hehe.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 647190341459834250,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
    "humanTl": true,
    "modified": 1784225385
}